<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brooklyn Union cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brooklyn Union cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter Reynolds has downgraded its rating of Brooklyn Union Gas Co to neutral from accumulate, a source at the firm said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- The source said the downgrade was based on the price of the stock.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
